# Boss 1: the mothership, 24x16: a dome between notched shoulders, an
# antenna rising from each shoulder (the top 4 rows, BOSS_TOP in the
# game).  Moves at most half a pixel a frame each way, so a 1-pixel halo.
# The black opening in the middle (columns 10-13, rows 8-11) is where the
# core sits; the channel below it lets shots in.
sprite boss1 artifact halo 1 1
O......................O
.W....................W.
.W....................W.
..W..................W..
..W....WWWWWWWWWW....W..
...W..WOOOOOOOOOOW..W...
...W..WBBOOOOOOBBW..W...
....W.WBBBOOOOBBBW.W....
WWWWWWOBBO....OBBOWWWWWW
WOOOOOOOOO....OOOOOOOOOW
WWOOOOOOOO....OOOOOOOOWW
.WWWOOOOOO....OOOOOOWWW.
...WWWWOOO....OOOWWWW...
....BB.WWW....WWW.BB....
....BB............BB....
....OO............OO....
end

# Boss envoy, 8x8: flies beside the boss (moving with it) and bombs.
sprite envoy artifact halo 1 1
..WWWW..
.WBBBBW.
WBBWWBBW
WBWOOWBW
WBBWWBBW
.WBBBBW.
..O..O..
.O....O.
end

